 "doc": "M5-A3P-1004 (docs/kb/tech/chapter_flow.md; act3_ch18.md \u00a72): Ch18 'The Kite', the critical path. K01 the maiden flight (arrive on the Kite: Ch17's boarding goes here), K02 the chart table (the world opens: kite_flying, the Kite's world map in the field menu), then the map to Reedhollow (its Act III block here; ChapterRegistry gives this file the zone from chapter 18): K03-K04 through the gate on arrival, K05 the farewell-tide taught on the shore, which takes them back aboard at night: K07, the night's rest, and in the morning K08 at the chart table (Iskarra), played on that arrival so nobody is left ashore without a way back to the deck. The revisits are offered between K02 and K05. K06 (the child, optional) and Pell's heirloom are triggers at Reedhollow; Ysolde's heirloom and Ansedra from the air are on the deck. The revisits (Hollowmere, Corrow, Tamsule, Pemakar, Quellan) and their heirlooms are triggers in those zones, each under this file's block for the zone; Oruvel waits on its rebuilt look and a Kite destination, Haluna on a HalunaStory hook. Iskarra (K08) goes on to Ch19's plaza (ch19/iskarra, Landing). A revisit zone's block has no arrive row that holds with the story done (M5-A3P-1981's guard): the Kite's landing places the party and the zone applies its own states and light; the block is there so the zone's earlier chapter's arrival can't play (ChapterRegistry).",
